# An inverse SIP coefficient of degree 10, BP_9_1 = 0.0, on an order-2
# SIP header with BP_ORDER = 1 (synthetic; twin of sip_zero_coeff_deg10).
# wcslib 8.10 sipset refuses any SIP coefficient with p + q > 9, forward
# or inverse, whatever its value and *_ORDER. AP/BP are given so hdr2sky injects nothing.
# EXPECT-WCSLIB-ERROR: Invalid powers (9, 1) for SIP on axis 2
NOTE reject: sip_inverse_coeff_deg10
GRID 1 1024 9 1 1024 9
HEADER
NAXIS   = 2
NAXIS1  = 1024
NAXIS2  = 1024
CRVAL1  = 150.0
CRVAL2  = 2.0
CRPIX1  = 512.5
CRPIX2  = 512.5
CTYPE1  = 'RA---TAN'
CTYPE2  = 'DEC--TAN'
CD1_1   = -0.0002777
CD1_2   = 0.0
CD2_1   = 0.0
CD2_2   = 0.0002777
A_ORDER = 2
B_ORDER = 2
A_2_0   = 2e-5
A_1_1   = 1e-5
B_0_2   = 2e-5
B_1_1   = -1e-5
BP_9_1  = 0.0
AP_ORDER= 1
AP_0_0  = 0.0
BP_ORDER= 1
BP_0_0  = 0.0
